        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "Crews are igniting vegetation between control lines and the main fires in areas where steep terrain, heavy fuels and safety concerns make direct attack difficult. By Mosabber Hossain About a month ago, two wildfires ignited a day apart in southwest Montana. The Bobcat Lakes Fire started July 31 near Wise River, followed by the Sand Creek Fire on Aug. 1 near Wisdom.&nbsp;"
